          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 63,
          "text": "1. Audit Objective"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 87,
          "text": "To assess compliance with the Order Intake Approval Authority Matrix and Order Backlog monitoring requirements"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 102,
          "text": "under POL-ORD-003 v1.0, and evaluate control CTRL-REV-016."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 129,
          "text": "2. Background and Scope"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 156,
          "text": "This audit plan covers orders booked between January 2025 and May 2025 for approval matrix testing, and quarterly"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 168,
          "text": "Backlog review reports for Q4 2024 and Q1 2025 for aging testing."
        },
