        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 456,
          "text": "4.2 Sample Selection Approach"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 477,
          "text": "- Approval testing population: Orders booked Jan–May 2025 (n = 210)"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 495,
          "text": "- Approval sample size: 20 orders, stratified across all 3 value tiers"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 510,
          "text": "- Backlog testing: All items in Backlog >300 days as of review date (n = 27), full population tested"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 543,
          "text": "5. Testing Procedures Performed"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 567,
          "text": "- Traced order value to approver identity and role in system"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 585,
          "text": "- Cross-referenced approver role against Table 1 (Delegation of Authority) in POL-ORD-003 v1.0"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 600,
          "text": "-"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 603,
          "text": "- Recalculated aging using Aging (Days) = Current Date Original Order Booking Date"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 618,
          "text": "- Confirmed items >365 days were flagged and reviewed by Finance Manager"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 636,
          "text": "- Obtained quarterly Backlog review sign-off evidence for Q4 2024 and Q1 2025"
